{"seq":48,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1099"},"reason":"The German and Russian 1865 sentences now name the product (Holzschliff / древесная масса) so the corrected answer sits in a sentence that gives it; table updated; notes accept \"paper\".","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nokia"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",1004],["-","paper"],["+","wood"],["=",1],["+","pulp "],["=",175]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",232],["-","Holzschleiferei"],["+","Holzschleiferei,"],["=",1],["+","die Holzschliff "],["=",6],["+","erzeugte, "],["=",664],["-","Papier"],["+","Holzschliff"],["=",168]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",244],["-","фабрику"],["+","фабрику,"],["=",1],["-","древесной"],["+","продукцией"],["=",1],["-","массы"],["+","которой"],["=",1],["+","была древесная масса "],["=",682],["-","бумага"],["+","древесная"],["=",1],["+","масса "],["=",165]]},{"field":"notesEn","old":"","new":"Nokia: \"paper\" is also accepted – the pulp was ground for paper-making, and paper soon became the company's main product."},{"field":"notesDe","old":"","new":"Nokia: „Papier“ gilt ebenfalls – der Holzschliff diente der Papierherstellung, und bald wurde Papier das Hauptprodukt des Unternehmens."},{"field":"notesRu","old":"","new":"Nokia: ответ «бумага» тоже принимается — древесная масса шла на производство бумаги, и вскоре бумага стала главной продукцией компании."}],"hash":"361ea46421be","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"c4655007a5f3266871851ccd5fdca5580ab2ad19e9aed525b966298efc9826a8"},
